10
00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:33.550
extend report-only, or enforce with
exclusions that are dated and owned.

11
00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:38.422
The scope file is the record: each
in-scope principal by object I D and ring,

12
00:00:38.422 --> 00:00:43.538
